**Changed**
- `document-share.service.ts`: now resolves the caller's `RolePermissionConfig` from the ambient context and passes it to `getRepository('document')` (the create path previously passed nothing, so the app object was denied outright and every share creation was fail-closed into FORBIDDEN — the same seam P2.5 fixed in search); `findManyDocumentShares` filters to documents the caller can read; `getShareForGuest` re-validates the source lifecycle under a system context and denies archived/deleted/uninstalled with NOT_FOUND.
